+# Icons
+
+`icon1.svg` and `platform-mark.svg` are original local ForgeCart Studio interface marks. The mark combines a compact storefront frame, modular content blocks, and an amber forge spark using the approved palette.
+
+Store only sanitized SVG interface marks or small UI icons in this folder. Do not place third-party logos, platform logos, remote icon packs, or primary portfolio imagery here.
